(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[19] = {"n": 19, "title": "Verb Forms and Agreement", "ar": "أَحْكَامُ الْفِعْلِ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>You will connect a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span>, meaning and relationship to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>. Keep these questions separate: <b>When? Which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span>? Who or what fills the grammatical role? Which ending, and why?</b></p><p>Prerequisites: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي والمضارع والأمر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع ونصب وجزم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل ونائب الفاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمير المستتر والمتصل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى والجمع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفاعل واسم المفعول</span>. Brief reminders appear where needed. In each exercise, choose one answer per control; where two expressions are permissible, the correct choice explicitly includes both.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزمن وصيغة الفعل</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span></b> places an event before <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التكلّم</span></b>, the moment of speaking: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمَنَ</span></b>: he believed. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span></b> can describe <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال / الحاضر</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٌ يصلّي الآنَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ تصومُ غدًا</span></b>. Its initial <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span></b> is one of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ، ن، ي، ت</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span></b> expresses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب الفعل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبْ</span></b>: write.</p><p>Learn these indicators with their particular functions:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Indicator</th><th>Reading practised here</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التأكيد</span> with an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص الحال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَنَدْخُلُ المسجدَ الحرامَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين أو سوف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص المستقبل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَنَطُوفُ بالبيتِ؛ سوف نَسْعَى</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لَنَدْعُوَنَّ اللهَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَيَكْتُبُ خالدٌ رسالةً</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين حرف استقبال؛ يكتب فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع بالضمة؛ رسالة مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The future meaning does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> or change its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل</span></b> = before; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد</span></b> = after; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span></b> = at; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يختصّ</span></b> = is restricted to.</p><div class=\"readbox\"><p>Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع يدلّ على الحال أو المستقبل، وتخصّصه السين بالمستقبل</span>.</b></p></div></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each expression to its meaning.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب أمس</span></b> places the action before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التكلّم</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب الآن</span></b> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيكتب</span></b> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب أمس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب الآن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيكتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيفتحُ سالمٌ البابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين للاستقبال؛ يفتح مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ سالم فاعل مرفوع بالضمة؛ الباب مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة. السين</span> changes the time indicated, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استقبال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سالم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which expression both denies entry and places it in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن ندخلَ</span></b> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن الناصبة النافية</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَنَدْخُلُ</span></b> instead has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التأكيد</span> followed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَدْخُلُ</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَنَدْخُلُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن ندخلَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخلنا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف يقرأ عادل. ثم سيكتب رسالة</span>.</b> What do the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> tell you?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين</span></b> each specify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل. يقرأ ويكتب</span> remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعًا</span>; neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> here.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ مجزومًا</span>.", "Both actions are in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>.", "Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكتبُ الآنَ</span></b>, the initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> is:", "sol": "<p>The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> is one of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف المضارعة</span> and indicates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> form. It is not one of the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع يدلّ على الحال أو المستقبل</span>.</b> Which inference is sound?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> can refer to either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل. الآن، غدًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحروف</span> help determine the intended time.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every future meaning requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>.", "Identify context and attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> before choosing between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال والمستقبل</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> must refer to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صياغة الأمر</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">From <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span></h2><p>Start with the intended <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span></b> form of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع المجزوم</span></b> and remove <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span></b>. Preserve the appropriate ending: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبْ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبا</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبا</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبوا</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبي</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبي</span></b>. These show the forms before and after removal, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> formed from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغائب</span>.</p><p>If the remaining first letter is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك</span>, no extra opening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> is needed: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُعَلِّمْ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلِّمْ</span></b>. If it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكن</span>, begin with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span></b>, pronounced when starting and omitted in connected pronunciation:</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة عين الكلمة</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> pattern</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة أو كسرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسورة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَفْتَحْ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِفْتَحْ؛ تَجْلِسْ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِجْلِسْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضمومة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَسْجُدْ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُسْجُدْ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين الكلمة</span></b> means the second original letter of the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جذر</span></b>, not necessarily the second written letter of a longer form.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب الإفعال</span></b> requires special care: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرِمُ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمْ</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة قطع مفتوحة</span></b>, pronounced even after another word. The pattern is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفْعِلْ</span></b>; its derivation preserves the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> in the underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُؤَفْعِلُ</span></b>. This underlying pattern explains the derivation; the ordinary spoken <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرِمُ</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمُوا الضيفَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرموا فعل أمر مبني على حذف النون؛ الواو ضمير في محل رفع فاعل؛ الألف بعد الواو فارقة لا محل لها؛ الضيف مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة قطع</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span> meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احذف</span></b> = remove; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زد</span></b> = add; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكن</span></b> = carrying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "From <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span> from these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span> forms after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.", "sol": "<p>Remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">افتح</span></b> needs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة وصل مكسورة</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين الكلمة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسجد</span></b> needs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة وصل مضمومة</span> because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علّم</span></b> already starts with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك</span> letter.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفتحْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُفْتَحْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَفْتَحْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِفْتَحْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسجدْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْجُدْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سْجُدْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُسْجُدْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُعَلِّمْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِعَلِّمْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُعَلِّمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلِّمْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبا الجوابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون؛ ألف الاثنين فاعل؛ الجواب مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطبان</span> are expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجهول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف فاصلة بعد نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ</span> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُكْرِمْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب الإفعال</span> gives <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمْ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة قطع مفتوحة</span>. Do not apply the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span> choice to this pattern.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرِمُ، بحرف المضارعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِكْرِمْ، بهمزة وصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمْ، بهمزة قطع</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the instruction to one woman: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا هند، ... الجوابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبي</span></b> addresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ</span>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبي</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which two forms both address two people?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبان</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span></b> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> is formed from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span> form after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبانِ / اُكْتُبا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكتبُ / اُكْتُبوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ / اُكْتُبي</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن كان أول الباقي ساكنًا زيدت همزة الوصل</span>.</b> Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلِّمْ</span></b> need no added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span>?", "sol": "<p>After removing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُعلّمْ</span></b>, the remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ع</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علّمْ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>, so the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> for adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span> is absent.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> begins with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>.", "Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائب</span>.", "Its first remaining letter is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للفاعل والمبني للمفعول به</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Meaning and relationships</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للفاعل / المعلوم</span></b> retains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ خالدٌ الرسالةَ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للمفعول به / المجهول</span></b> omits the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and raises the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> into its place as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَتِ الرسالةُ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> still counts as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span> is not automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجهول</span>.</p><p>Here <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للفاعل</span></b> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صياغة</span>; it does not mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Changes within the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span></h2><p>For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span></b>, give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما قبل الآخر</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> and the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك</span> letters <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَصَرَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نُصِرَ؛ أَكْرَمَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكْرِمَ؛ زَلْزَلَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زُلْزِلَ؛ اِسْتَخْرَجَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُسْتُخْرِجَ؛ تَدَحْرَجَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُدُحْرِجَ</span></b>. This rule concerns the internal pattern, not replacing the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة البناء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.</p><p>An added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الكلمة</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَاسَبَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُوسِبَ؛ تَعَارَفَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُعُورِفَ</span></b>. In the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجوف</span></b> pattern represented by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال</span></b>, the middle original letter is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف علّة</span>: its underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الكلمة</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَالَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِيلَ</span></b>.</p><p>For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما قبل الآخر</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتُبُ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتَبُ؛ يُكْرِمُ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرَمُ؛ يَسْتَخْرِجُ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُسْتَخْرَجُ</span></b>. Its final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> still follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُكْتَبَ؛ لم يُكْتَبْ</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يُفْتَحْ البابُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم حرف نفي وجزم وقلب؛ يُفتح مضارع مبني للمفعول به، مجزوم بالسكون؛ الباب نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. There is no hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> as an additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in this analysis.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما قبل الآخر</span></b> = the letter before the last; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقوم مقامه</span></b> = takes its place.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Meaning and relationships"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Changes within the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للمفعول به</span> form.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكرم</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> then <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> before the last letter; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حوسب</span></b> changes the added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قيل</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجوف</span> pattern; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكتب</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before the final letter.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرِمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكْرِمَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَاسَبَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُاسَبَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَاسِبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُوسِبَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَالَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَالِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُالَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِيلَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتُبُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتَبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتَبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتِبُ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُغْلَقَ البابُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تنصب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُغلقَ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> its internal pattern is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للمفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابُ</span></b> fills <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يغلق</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني للمفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بالسكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل معلوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Change <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحَ الحارسُ البابَ</span></b> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للمفعول به</span>, omitting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارس</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح البابُ</span></b> changes the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> and gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب رفع</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>. Retaining its old <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> would leave the intended relationship unexpressed.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتِحَ البابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَتَحَ البابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتِحَ البابَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Someone points to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سالم</span> and says <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>. Which classification follows?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> is still a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Absence of a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> does not make <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجهولًا</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is hidden", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للمفعول به</span> because no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> follows", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للفاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the form for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم ... الكتابُ</span></b> with meaning “the book was not written”.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يُكتبْ الكتابُ</span></b> has the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للمفعول به</span> internal pattern and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم. الكتاب نائب فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "3R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتَبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتُبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتَبَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُضمّ حرف المضارعة ويُفتح ما قبل الآخر</span>.</b> Which form exemplifies both changes?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُستخرَجُ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ر</span>, the letter before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ج</span>. The last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> ending in this ungoverned form.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْتَخْرِجْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُسْتَخْرَجُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَسْتَخْرِجُ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصرف والجمود</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Classify the available <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المتصرّف</span></b> changes into other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّ التصرف</span></b> has a full range: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطَاعَ، يُطِيعُ، أَطِعْ، مُطِيعٌ، مِطْوَاعٌ</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مطواع</span> describes someone very obedient.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف</span></b> has a restricted range. Learn <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما زالَ / لا يزالُ</span></b> as the pair whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرف</span> reaches <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span> here, without the full series above. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَذَرُ، يَدَعُ</span></b> are also treated within limited <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرف</span> in this classification; recognise their use rather than constructing a full series by analogy.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المتصرّف / الجامد</span></b> does not transfer to another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> in the use being classified. Recognise: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اخلولق، نعم، بئس، حبّذا، ليس، ما دام، هاتِ</span></b>; also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا، عدا، ما خلا، ما عدا</span></b> when used for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span></b>. The restriction to a particular use matters: do not apply it indiscriminately to every use of the same letters.</p><p>Within <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجامد</span>, distinguish what accepts <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير الفاعل</span></b> attached to it, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس وعسى</span></b>, from what does not accept these attached forms, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم وبئس</span></b>. The latter still have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمود</span> does not mean absence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>Do not confuse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل الناقص</span></b> that takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا وخبرًا</span>. The two classifications answer different questions.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ غائبًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس فعل ماض ناقص جامد؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع اسم ليس؛ غائبًا خبر ليس منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> changes the person referred to without turning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span> into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>. With these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الناقصة</span>, give the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> its precise role <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفعل الناقص</span></b>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتصرّف إلى</span></b> = changes into; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يلحقه</span></b> = attaches to it; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا غير</span></b> = only.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Classify the available <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each series or use to its classification.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطاع</span> series illustrates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام التصرف</span>. The pair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما زال / لا يزال</span> illustrates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف. عدا</span> is classified as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> in the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استعمال الاستثناء</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطاع، يطيع، أطع، مطيع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام التصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما زال / لا يزال في التصنيف المدروس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام التصرف بهذه الصيغ وحدها</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدا بمعنى الاستثناء في هذا الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام التصرف في هذا الاستعمال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ حاضرًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> but accepts the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>. In this construction <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ليس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا خبرها منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع تام التصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص جامد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع اسم ليس</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which conclusion follows from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس / لستُ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>Changing the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> is distinct from the range of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span> used to classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرف</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>.", "Attaching a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> does not by itself produce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرف</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع وأمر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام التصرف</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Select the accurate statement about <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم وبئس</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم وبئس</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامدان</span>. Not accepting these attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر</span> does not remove their need for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["They are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامدان</span> and do not accept the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر الفاعل</span> discussed here.", "They have no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in any construction.", "They are ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> forms."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which classification asks about taking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا وخبرًا</span>, rather than the availability of other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل الناقص</span></b> concerns its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم وخبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف</span></b> concerns its restricted range of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للمفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل الناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص التصرف</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المتصرف يسمى فعلًا جامدًا</span>.</b> Which pair expresses the same classification?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متصرف</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span></b> name the same classification here. The other pairs combine separate classifications.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متصرف / مبني للمفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متصرف / جامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجهول / ناقص التصرف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي الفعل</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span></h2><p>Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كَذَبَ خالدٌ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b> enters <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدعاء</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا قدَّرَ اللهُ</span></b>; or with repetition <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا صدَّقَ ولا صلَّى</span></b>. It can also repeat <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرًا</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا اقتحم العقبة</span></b> can be understood through the following explanation as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا فكَّ رقبةً ولا أطعمَ يتيمًا أو مسكينًا</span></b>.</p><p>There is also a different reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا اقتحم العقبة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتحضيض بمعنى هلّا</span></b>, urging the action. Keep that reading distinct from the account using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> with repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> understood.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span></th><th>Meaning</th><th>Effect and example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> with the meaning shifted to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم: لم يَكْتُبْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></td><td>like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقّع الحصول</span>: not yet</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم: لمّا يَصِلْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي الحال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يَكْتُبُ الآنَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي الحال أو المستقبل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يَكْذِبُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد نفي المستقبل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب: لن يَكْذِبَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقّع الحصول</span></b> is an expectation, not a guarantee. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b> does not by itself mean “never for all eternity”. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span></b> does not govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>; distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تَكْذِبُ</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تَكْذِبْ</span></b>, where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span> requests that the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span> refrain.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يَصِلْ خالدٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا حرف نفي وجزم وقلب؛ يصل مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع</span>. The form is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>, but the meaning is “Khalid has not arrived yet”. Changing it to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يصلَ</span></b> changes both time and ending.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب معناه ماضيًا</span></b> = shifting its meaning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقّع الحصول</span></b> = expecting it to happen; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحضيض</span></b> = strong urging.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the expression to its distinctive meaning.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> shifts the meaning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b> adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقّع الحصول</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b> strengthens <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي المستقبل</span> and governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> with this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> denies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يخرجْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي مع قلب المعنى ماضيًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب الخروج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد حصول الخروج</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يخرجْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمان أنه خرج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر للمخاطب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي مع توقّع الحصول</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يخرجَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد نفي المستقبل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي الماضي بلم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يكتبُ الآن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد الماضي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي الحال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> in each expression.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يكذبُ سالم</span></b> the statement is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكذبْ</span></b> requests restraint and has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا قدّر الله</span></b> is the permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span> use with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يَكْذِبُ سالمٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية جازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية لا تجزم هنا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تَكْذِبْ يا سالم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية ناصبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية جازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التأكيد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا قدّر الله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء دخلت فيه لا على الماضي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتظرنا خالدًا. ... يصلْ، وننتظر وصوله</span>.</b> Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> explicitly expressing “not yet”.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ</span></b> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقّع الحصول. لن</span> would require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصلَ</span> and shift the meaning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> does not express this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا اقتحم العقبة</span></b>, how is repetition supplied?", "sol": "<p>The specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> account understands repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> through the subsequent explanation. The separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحضيض</span> reading takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا بمعنى هلّا</span>; do not mix the two accounts.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرًا: فلا فكّ رقبة ولا أطعم يتيمًا أو مسكينًا</span>", "By changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "By treating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقتحم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُفْتَحُ البابُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, so <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُفتحَ</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة. الباب</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُفْتَحْ البابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُفْتَحَ البابَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُفْتَحَ البابُ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقيل: لا للتحضيض بمعنى هلّا</span>.</b> What is this reading doing?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحضيض</span></b> is strong urging. This is a distinct reading from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا للنفي</span> with repetition understood.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Making a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>.", "Guaranteeing a future event.", "Urging the action strongly."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد ونوناه</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد والنون</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span></b> strengthens <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد فَهِمْنا الدرسَ</span></b>. It may be preceded by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التأكيد</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لقد فَهِمْنا الدرسَ</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> enters <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع بمعنى المستقبل, الأمر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لَأَكْتُبَنَّ؛ اُكْتُبَنَّ؛ لا تَكْذِبَنَّ</span></b>. It is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> filling the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> position.</p><p>There are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقيلة نَّ / نِّ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخفيفة نْ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثقيلة</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسورة</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المثنّى</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحة</span></b> elsewhere: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانِّ؛ أَطِعْنَانِّ؛ أَطِعَنَّ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خفيفة</span> does not enter with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>: the intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> followed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نْ</span> would produce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التقاء الساكنين</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span> to keep apart</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبان، تكتبون، تكتبين</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْنَ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنَّ / اكتبَنْ</span></b>. Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> before deciding the analysis.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبَنَّ الرسالةَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبنّ فعل أمر مبني على الفتح لاتصاله بنون التوكيد مباشرة؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنتَ؛ النون حرف توكيد لا محل له؛ الرسالة مفعول به منصوب</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْنَ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> there is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فيما سواهما</span></b> = in cases other than those two; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثقيلة / خفيفة</span></b> = the two forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد والنون</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span> to keep apart"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبون</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْنَ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنَّ / اكتبَنْ</span></b> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف توكيد</span>. Read the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> itself.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبونَ: النون الأخيرة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْنَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الخفيفة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُحْفَظَنَّ العهدَ</span></b> to one man.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> directly attaches to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>, giving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح. الفاعل مستتر أنتَ؛ العهد مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة؛ نون التوكيد</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احفظنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنتَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العهد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف توكيد لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct ending with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطيعانِّ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون الثقيلة المكسورة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المثنّى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خفيفة</span> is not admitted with it here.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانِّ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Add the two taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> strengthening <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فهمنا الدرس</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لقد</span></b> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التأكيد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي. لم ولن</span> enter <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فهمنا</span> in this use.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن فهمنا الدرس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لقد فهمنا الدرس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم فهمنا الدرس</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which instruction contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهيًا مؤكدًا</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكذبنّ</span></b> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> carrying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>. The other expressions are statements.</p>", "group": "6R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تَكْذِبَنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد كَتَبَ سالمٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يَكْذِبُ سالمٌ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تدخل الخفيفة مع ضمير المثنّى ونون النسوة</span>.</b> Which proposed form must be rejected?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطعنَانْ</span></b> wrongly adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخفيفة</span> after the separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>. Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقيلة المكسورة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطعنَانِّ</span></b>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَانْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعَنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَانِّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يتغيّر عند إلحاق نون التوكيد</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Preserve the relationship when letters disappear</h2><p>When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> enters a form with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span></b>, remove the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span></b>, retain the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> and give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون الثقيلة كسرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبانِ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبَانِّ</span></b>. The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>, not the old <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>.</p><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span></b> patterns such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبون / تكتبين</span></b>, remove <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الفاعل / ياء الفاعل</span></b> as well; the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة / كسرة</span> indicates the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Intended reference</th><th>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يكتبون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبُنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة المحذوفة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ تكتبين</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبِنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة المحذوفة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ تكتب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنتَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> in the first two remains <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرًا</span></b> in its role. Do not replace it with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> analysis of these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>, distinguish the removed spoken <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب المقدّرة</span></b>; the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد</span>.</p><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b>, keep that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> and insert <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span></b> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَانِّ</span></b>. The added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> separates the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَانِّ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطع فعل أمر مبني على السكون؛ نون النسوة ضمير في محل رفع فاعل؛ الألف فاصلة؛ النون الثقيلة حرف توكيد مكسور</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانِّ</span></b>, where the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is itself <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المثنّى</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على حذف النون</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُحذف</span></b> = is removed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر</span></b> = understood though not expressed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصلة</span></b> = separating.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Preserve the relationship when letters disappear"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> to the emphasised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نّ</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكتبُنّ</span></b> indicates omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتكتبِنّ</span></b> indicates omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتكتبَنّ</span></b> belongs to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ</span> form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يكتبون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبُنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبَنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبَانِّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ تكتبين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَانِّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبِنَّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ تكتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبِنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبُنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَنَّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse the elements added after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطع</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعْنَانِّ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> remains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span> separates it from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة المكسورة</span>. Neither the separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> nor the last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> introduces another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون الأولى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف فاصلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون المشددة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون إعراب مرفوعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة الثانية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون توكيد ثقيلة مكسورة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيَكْتُبَانِّ</span></b>, what happened to the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبانِ</span>?", "sol": "<p>Remove the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> when adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد. ألف الاثنين</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقيلة</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["It remains unchanged and no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> was added.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> was removed; the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>.", "It became <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the analysis: “In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبِنَّ</span></b> addressed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ, نون التوكيد</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is omitted in expression but remains the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>. The preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> indicates it; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل ألف فاصلة</span>.", "There is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> once <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span> disappears.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل ياء المخاطبة المحذوفة، والنون حرف توكيد</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which pair distinguishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الفاعل</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف فاصلة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>?", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطيعانِّ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطعنَانِّ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصلة</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِعَنَّ / أَطِعَنْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَطِيعَانِّ / أَطِعْنَانِّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ / كتبَ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويكون الفاعل مقدّرًا</span>.</b> Applied to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكتبُنّ</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>, what remains understood?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span></b> is removed from the expressed form but remains understood in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> points to it.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة المحذوفة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث الواجب والممتنع</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">First recognise the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span></h2><p>The relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء الساكنة</span></b> at the end of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span></b> at the start of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء المربوطة</span></b> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفاعل والمفعول</span>. Not every initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> is for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ تكتبُ</span></b> addresses a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق علامة التأنيث ممتنع</span></b> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر فاعل</span> that is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد، مثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع سالم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصلّي المعلّمُ؛ سيحجّ المعلّمونَ</span></b>. The same principle applies to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأبُ صائمٌ ولداهُ</span></b>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صامَ إلّا فاطمةُ</span></b>, retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> in the account based on <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صامَ أحدٌ إلّا فاطمةُ</span></b>. Recognise this particular construction instead of mechanically adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق علامة التأنيث واجب</span></b> when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا ظاهرًا مؤنّثًا حقيقيًّا متّصلًا بالفعل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجَتْ هندٌ</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متصل</span> means no intervening expression; it does not mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضميرًا لمؤنّث حقيقي أو سماعي</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٌ خرجَتْ؛ الشمسُ طلعَتْ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> inside each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هي. مؤنث سماعي</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span>, is treated as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> in Arabic without denoting a female being.</li></ul><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمسُ طلعَتْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس مبتدأ مرفوع؛ طلعت فعل ماض مبني على الفتح، والتاء للتأنيث لا محل لها؛ الفاعل مستتر تقديره هي؛ الجملة الفعلية في محل رفع خبر</span>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث واجب</span> because the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر الشمس</span> directly following the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span></b> = required; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع</span></b> = excluded; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق</span></b> = attaching.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "First recognise the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق علامة التأنيث</span> in the stated constructions.", "sol": "<p>An adjacent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> each require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر جمع المذكر السالم</span> here excludes it.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت هند: فاعل ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي بلا فاصل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز فقط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلعت: الفاعل ضمير هي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز فقط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلمون: جمع مذكر سالم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٌ خرجَتْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند مبتدأ؛ خرجت فعل ماض مبني على الفتح، تاؤه للتأنيث؛ الفاعل مستتر هي؛ الجملة خبر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة التأنيث لا محل لها</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل خرجت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء الساكنة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند فاعل مقدّم في هذا التحليل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت مع فاعلها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete with the form required by the ordinary adjacent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: <b>... <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريمُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت مريم</span></b> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي</span> with no separating expression.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَتْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرُوا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which explanation matches <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صامَ إلّا فاطمةُ</span></b> in the account taught here?", "sol": "<p>The stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> is explained by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صام أحد إلا فاطمة</span></b>. This does not reclassify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صام</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["The understood basis is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صام أحد إلا فاطمة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span> is classified as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صام</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> addressed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ تكتبُ</span></b>, does the initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> prove that the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب</span></b> can address <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ</span>. Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> from the construction rather than treating every initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دليل التأنيث</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["Yes; every initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي</span>.", "No; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> is also used for the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ</span> form.", "Yes; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا ظاهرًا مؤنثًا حقيقيًّا متصلًا بالفعل</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متصلًا</span> mean in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>?", "sol": "<p>Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتصال</span> concerns adjacency: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت هند</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> explicitly describes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> has become part of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جذر</span>.", "No expression intervenes between the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> must be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث الجائز وسقوط العلامة</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Four contexts for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواز</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز</span></b> means either expression is permitted in the specified context.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Context</th><th>Examples and reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث فاعل</span> separated from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ خالدًا هندٌ / أَكْرَمَتْ خالدًا هندٌ</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> intervenes</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث غير حقيقي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طَلَعَ الشمسُ / طَلَعَتِ الشمسُ</span>; compare the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> case <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلعت</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر أو اسم جمع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجالُ صلَّتْ / الرجالُ صلَّوا</span>: the first treats them as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جماعة</span>, the second as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفراد</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم وبئس</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعْمَ الأمُّ خديجةُ / نِعْمَتِ الأمُّ خديجةُ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The second context includes collective treatment of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر</span> forms such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأعراب، نسوة، قوم</span></b>: recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالت الأعرابُ، قال نسوةٌ، كذّبت قومُ نوحٍ</span></b>. The corresponding variation also occurs with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مختلفًا ألوانُه</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لاهيةً قلوبُهم</span></b> illustrate the two treatments in their larger constructions.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جماعة</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال صلّت</span></b> is a specific allowance. It does not abolish the normal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> agreement or authorise arbitrary changes with every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجار والمجرور</span> fills the position</h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة التأنيث</span> drops when <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجار والمجرور</span></b> stands <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقام الفاعل أو نائب الفاعل</span></b> in this analysis: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كفى بجهنّمَ سعيرًا؛ جِيءَ يومئذٍ بجهنّمَ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> inside the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيئت</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَتْ خالدًا هندٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمت فعل ماض مبني على الفتح، والتاء للتأنيث؛ خالدًا مفعول به مقدّم منصوب؛ هند فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع</span>. The intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> makes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> permissible rather than compulsory; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدًا هند</span></b> is also permitted. Word order does not turn <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> into the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل عن</span></b> = separated from; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعود إلى</span></b> = refers back to; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسقط</span></b> = drops.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Four contexts for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواز</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجار والمجرور</span> fills the position"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the permitted pair in each specified context.", "sol": "<p>The permitted pairs show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز التأنيث: ظاهر مؤنث غير حقيقي</span>; a separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث فاعل</span>; and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي</span>. Each pair preserves the specified relationship.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر الشمس</span> after the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلع الشمس / طلعت الشمس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلعوا الشمس / طلعتا الشمس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلع / الشمس طلعوا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> separates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدٌ هندًا / أكرمت خالدٌ هندًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدًا هند / أكرمت خالدًا هند</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرموا خالدًا هند / أكرمتا خالدًا هند</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعموا الأم / نعمتا الأم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم الأم / نعمت الأم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعمن الأم / نعموا الأم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمَ خالدًا هندٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم فعل ماض؛ خالدًا مفعول به مقدّم بالفتحة؛ هند فاعل مؤخّر بالضمة</span>. The separator allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> although <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث حقيقي</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بهمزة قطع هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترك تاء التأنيث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خطأ في كل حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب لأن هند مذكر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز لوجود الفاصل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement accurately explains <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال صلّت / الرجال صلّوا</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>For this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّت</span></b> returns a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جماعة</span> reading; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّوا</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> referring to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفراد</span>. This is the specific allowance being practised.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["Both use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>.", "The first treats <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال</span> as one named woman.", "The first allows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جماعة</span> reading; the second follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفراد الجمع</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the form where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجار والمجرور</span> stands <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقام نائب الفاعل</span>: <b>... <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بجهنّمَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء بجهنم</span></b> has the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> position in this account. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة التأنيث</span> is dropped; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جهنم</span> inside it does not trigger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيئت</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيئَتْ</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جهنم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاؤوا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which pair correctly distinguishes the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span> constructions?", "sol": "<p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلعت</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هي</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span>. With following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر الشمس, التأنيث غير الحقيقي</span> admits both forms.</p>", "group": "9R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلع</span> is required because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعي</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلعت: واجب؛ طلع الشمس / طلعت الشمس: جائز</span>", "Both always forbid <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا كان الفاعل ضميرًا يعود إلى مجموع مكسّر أو اسم جمع</span>.</b> What must you identify first?", "sol": "<p>This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> concerns the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرجع</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and its classification. The final spelling alone does not establish it.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Only whether the last letter is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span>.", "Whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in every case.", "What the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> refers back to and whether it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جمع</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توحيد الفعل والضمير</span>", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>?</h2><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل اسم ظاهر</span></b>, the ordinary construction keeps the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مفردًا</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ المعلّمُ؛ حضرَ المعلّمانِ؛ حضرَ المعلّمونَ</span></b>. The ending on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> changes; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> does not acquire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span>.</p><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ضمير</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> follows its reference: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمُ حضرَ؛ المعلّمانِ حضرَا؛ المعلّمونَ حضرُوا</span></b>. The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. In the last two, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> are the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>If <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل شبه جملة</span></b>, vary the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ به؛ جِيءَ بهما؛ جِيءَ بهم</span></b>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span>, likewise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممرورٌ بهم</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع ضمير</span> inside a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> attached to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمانِ حضرَا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى؛ حضرا فعل ماض مبني على الفتح، والألف ضمير في محل رفع فاعل؛ الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ المعلّمانِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان</span> is now the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بهم</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء فعل ماض مبني للمفعول به، مبني على الفتح؛ الباء حرف جر؛ هم ضمير في محل جر بالباء؛ الجار والمجرور في محل رفع نائب الفاعل</span> in the analysis used here. Separate the inner <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> from the role of the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُوحَّد</span></b> = is put in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> form; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُثنّى</span></b> = in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> form; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُجمع</span></b> = in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> form.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>?"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete using the ordinary analysis with the given word order.", "sol": "<p>With following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمان</span></b>. With initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>, the embedded <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is a matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان حضرا؛ المعلّمون حضروا</span></b>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "... <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرُوا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان</span> ...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرُوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمون</span> ...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرُوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بهم</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span></b> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا. الباء حرف جر؛ هم في محل جر؛</span> the whole <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نائب الفاعل</span> in the specified account. The inner and outer roles are different.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر للمخاطبين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني للمفعول به، مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض معلوم مع واو الجماعة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل بجيء في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر بالباء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهم كله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل معلوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نائب الفاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Rewrite <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الحارسان</span></b> beginning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان</span>, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان حضرا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة خبر</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان حضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان حضروا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان حضرا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Change only the reference in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء به</span></b> from one man to two, then several.", "sol": "<p>When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> changes: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهما، بهم</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> stays <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span></b>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيئا به / جيئوا به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء بهما / جيء بهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءا / جاؤوا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات كتبْنَ</span></b>, identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> inside the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبن</span></b> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> form the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر. نون النسوة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "10R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات فاعل مقدّم</span> in this analysis", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوحّد المجرور ويثنّى ويجمع لا ضمير الفعل</span>.</b> Which sequence illustrates this with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل شبه جملة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The varying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> belongs inside the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور: به، بهما، بهم</span>. It is not a matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> attached to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء به / جيء بهما / جيء بهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر / حضرا / حضروا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب / اكتبا / اكتبوا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءات خاصة وشبه الفعل</span>", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Do not assign two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلان</span></h2><p>Some expressions have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> form before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وأسرّوا النجوى الذين ظلموا</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتعاقبون فيكم ملائكةٌ بالليل وملائكةٌ بالنهار</span></b>. Keep these distinct analyses available:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Analysis</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></th><th>Following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة أكلوني البراغيث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جمع، لا ضمير فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل من الفاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم وتأخير</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وأسرّوا النجوى الذين ظلموا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذين ظلموا مبتدأ مؤخّر؛ الجملة السابقة خبر مقدّم</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These are alternative analyses, not roles to assign simultaneously. Questions specify the analysis to apply. The special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة</span> does not replace the ordinary pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمون</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\">A distinction for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span></b> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر فاعل</span> when it is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالٍ عن ضمير</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُشَّعًا أبصارُهم</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُشَّع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع خاشع</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Do not turn this allowance for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span> into unrestricted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> of an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> before its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p>In the excerpt <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُشَّعًا أبصارُهم</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة</span> in its larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لخشع مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. There is no additional hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشع</span> in this account. The excerpt shows a relationship within a larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, not a complete independent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالٍ عن</span></b> = free of; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل من</span></b> = <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> referring to the preceding expression; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم وتأخير</span></b> = a changed order of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> elements.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Do not assign two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلان</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "A distinction for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وأسرّوا النجوى الذين ظلموا</span></b>, match the specified analysis to the role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسرّوا</span>.", "sol": "<p>On the special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة, الواو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جمع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذين</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر, الواو</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ضمير</span>. Do not combine these alternative roles.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة أكلوني البراغيث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل والظاهر فاعل ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جمع لا ضمير فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذين بدل من الفاعل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جمع فقط</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذين مبتدأ مؤخّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل داخل الخبر المقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse the excerpt <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُشَّعًا أبصارُهم</span></b> in its larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصارُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لخشع مرفوع بالضمة ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه. شبه الفعل</span> here has no internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ضمير</span> and may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب وهو جمع خاشع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل من واو الجماعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لخشع مرفوع وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان لخشع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span> analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتعاقبون فيكم ملائكةٌ</span></b>, what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملائكة</span>?", "sol": "<p>With the stipulated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span> account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملائكة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل منه مرفوع</span>. Calling it a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> would mix analyses.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل مرفوع من ضمير الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان</span> in addition to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which ordinary pattern remains correct alongside the special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The ordinary pattern is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمون</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد فعل</span>. The special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغة</span> has its own analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمون مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضروا المعلّمون</span> with both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمون</span> independently <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> permits the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع شبه الفعل</span> illustrated by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا أبصارهم</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The allowance concerns <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل الخالي عن ضمير</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>. It does not change the ordinary rule for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> with a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "11R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصارهم</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل خالٍ عن ضمير، وفاعله اسم ظاهر</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو هو بدل من الفاعل</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو</span> signal here?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو</span></b> introduces a different possible account. Choose one coherent analysis rather than giving the same expression incompatible roles at once.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["That the expression has no possible analysis.", "An alternative analysis to apply separately.", "An additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> to assign at the same time."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجمع الصيغة والمعنى والتركيب</span>", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Read each prompt for the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and analytical account. Explain the relationship before selecting an ending. Some choices contain two permissible forms; choose the entire correct pair.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which change preserves <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span> while changing to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للمفعول به</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكرمَ</span></b> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضيًا</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني للمفعول به. أَكرمْ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكرمُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع معلوم</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْرِمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرِمْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكْرِمَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct distinction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and availability of other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span> are separate matters. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامدًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> still requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس تام التصرف</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ</span> exists.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس جامد؛ اتصال التاء في لستُ لا يجعله تام التصرف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "A3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطيعانِّ / أطعنَانِّ</span></b>, which element is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> respectively?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطيعانِّ</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطعنَانِّ</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and inserts <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف فاصلة</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد / الألف الفاصلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب / نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين / نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "B1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن ... البابُ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني للمفعول به</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يُكسرَ البابُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تنصب؛ يُكسر مبني للمفعول به؛ الباب نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْسَرْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْسَرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْسِرُ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "To <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ</span>, choose the emphasised form corresponding to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبين</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتكتبِنّ</span></b> omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> and the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نّ</span> indicates the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَانِّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبَنَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَتَكْتُبِنَّ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "B3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which correction follows the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر</span> analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان حضر</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> needs its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ضمير</span> to refer to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى مبتدأ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرا</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان حضرت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان حضرا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان حضروا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الحارسان. فُتِح الباب. لمّا يدخل الضيوف</span>.</b> Supply the analyses and endings required by the intended statements.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الحارسانِ</span></b> keeps <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر مفردًا</span> and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان بالألف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح البابُ</span></b> raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يدخلْ الضيوفُ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> and means the guests have not entered yet, with expectation of entry.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارسان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ في الجملة الأولى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل معلوم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدخل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَدْخُلْ: مجزوم بلمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَدْخُلَ: منصوب بلمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَدْخُلُ: مرفوع بلمّا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب الدخول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي مع توقّع الدخول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد حصول الدخول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete a full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَتَكْتُبُ مريمُ رسالةً</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين للاستقبال؛ تكتب مضارع مرفوع بالضمة وتاؤه للتأنيث؛ مريم فاعل مرفوع بالضمة؛ رسالة مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة. التأنيث واجب</span> with adjacent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر مؤنث حقيقي</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استقبال لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني للمفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على السكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة، والتاء للتأنيث</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر في هذا التحليل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم التأنيث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع لأن الفاعل ظاهر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب مع هذا الفاعل الظاهر المتصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز فقط لأن الفعل مستقبل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طلعت. حضر المعلمون. جيء بهم</span>.</b> Apply the ordinary analyses and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> account for the last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلعت</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هي</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث واجبًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل المعلمون</span>, so it stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء بهم</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> position, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> internally is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل طلعت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء الساكنة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس فاعل مقدّم هنا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل حضر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلمون، مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هم مع ظاهر فاعل ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو محذوفة مع نون التوكيد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع نائب الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل متصل بجيء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تدخل لا على الماضي إذا تكررت لفظًا أو تقديرًا</span>.</b> Which expression shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا صدّق ولا صلّى</span></b> repeats <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> explicitly. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span> contrasts with an understood repetition <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرًا</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا صدّق ولا صلّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لقد كتب</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن كان الفاعل اسمًا ظاهرًا وُحّد الفعل</span>.</b> Choose its ordinary application.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخل الضيوف</span></b> has a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد فعل</span>. Preposing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيوف</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> would instead require a matching embedded <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, as in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيوف دخلوا</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخلوا الضيوف</span> with two simultaneous <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخل الضيوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيوف دخل</span> with no matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "D3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل خالٍ عن ضمير</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا أبصارهم</span></b>, which analysis fits this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشعًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه فعل, جمع خاشع. أبصار</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. No extra <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ضمير</span> is assigned inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشع</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار فاعل لخشع؛ لا فاعل ضمير إضافي فيه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشع فعل ماض</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> its attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبصار مفعول به</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشع</span> has two hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلان</span>."], "ans": 0}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>Can you form a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>, recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلوم والمجهول</span>, distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span>, and justify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث والتوحيد</span> from the actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>? Revisit the relevant lesson whenever you recognise an ending without being able to explain its relationship.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزمن والأمر</span>: Lessons 1–2.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلوم والمجهول والتصرف</span>: Lessons 3–4.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النفي والتأكيد والنونات</span>: Lessons 5–7.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span>: Lessons 8–9.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوحيد والتحليلات الخاصة</span>: Lessons 10–11.</li></ul>"};
